---
description: Cross-module code uses barrels; @/config is the extra import
globs: src/modules/**
alwaysApply: false
---

# Module public API

- Other modules import `@/modules/<name>`, not `@/modules/<name>/<slot>/...`.
- `@/config` and `@/config/*` are always allowed.
- `index.ts` exports integration surface only (components, hooks, types, store accessors, api). Do not re-export all of root config. Do not export test-only helpers.
- Same-module deep imports are fine. `api` ↔ `session` may deep-import to avoid circular barrels.
